# Generated runtime state (scenario snapshots, Level B/C job state, node-health
# checks, time-sync logs) -- grows unbounded with every real run, never source.
# Found tracked (141 scenario_snapshot manifests alone, 268 MB) despite being
# pure generated output, same category already excluded for evidence_store/
# foc-reconstruction's own generated files above. Anchored to the repo ROOT
# (leading slash) on purpose -- an unanchored "runtime/" also matched real,
# versioned config data living under unrelated nested "runtime" directories
# (e.g. app_core/infrastructure/attack/runtime/'s industrial asset maps),
# caught live before committing this.
/runtime/

